{"version":1,"content":"<p>針對美國聯邦通訊委員會（FCC）投票通過檢測實驗室限制措施，中國商務部新聞發言人周五（30日）表示，中方對此強烈不滿，堅決反對，前期已採取反制措施予以回應。</p><p>如美方一意孤行，中方將進一步採取必要措施，堅定維護自身正當權益。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:13.656617+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":111,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T01:04:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T03:59:24.874129+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:30:42.062851+00:00","content_hash":"e896e416c9f59acfa92cbe8f77832171ff92e046c4ac3a100abf221afff4fbdb","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}